      <data key="d1">"Rennes is a picturesque city in France where INSA Rennes is located, and where Perrine Paul-Gilloteaux began her academic journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0074</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF SEVILLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University of Seville is a Spanish university where Perrine Paul-Gilloteaux pursued her undergraduate studies and received her degree."&lt;SEP&gt;"University of Seville is an educational institution planning to establish a new research center for microbiome research."</data>
